---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Pratik Gupta" description="Pratik Gupta — Engineer and photographer based in Toronto, Ontario. Architecture, landscapes, wildlife, and aviation.">
  <article class="about-page reveal">
    <div class="about-container">
      <p class="about-eyebrow">Engineer and photographer, based in Toronto</p>
      <h1 class="about-title">Pratik Gupta</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">
        A different perspective on architecture, landscapes, wildlife, and aircraft.
      </p>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-content">
          <p>
            Based in Toronto, Ontario, I work across software engineering and still photography.
            Photography for me is an exercise in patience and observation — catching high-speed aircraft
            banking against clouds, the crisp geometry of modern city towers, or quiet moments of wildlife
            in natural habitats.
          </p>
          <p>
            This portfolio is built as a digital darkroom: minimal chrome, no distracting borders,
            and pure focus on the tone and detail of each print.
          </p>

          <h2 class="about-section-heading">Disciplines</h2>
          <ul class="about-list">
            <li><strong>Aviation:</strong> High-speed military jets, aerobatics, and air shows.</li>
            <li><strong>Architecture:</strong> Skylines, structural symmetry, and urban geometry in Toronto, Chicago, and beyond.</li>
            <li><strong>Landscapes:</strong> Coastal shores, lake atmospheres, and mountain ranges.</li>
            <li><strong>Wildlife:</strong> Birds in flight, native mammals, and candid moments in nature.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="about-actions">
            <a href="/collections/" class="about-link">Browse the gallery</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="about-sidebar">
          <div class="about-sidebar-card">
            <h3 class="about-sidebar-title">Location</h3>
            <p class="about-sidebar-val">Toronto, Ontario, Canada</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-sidebar-card">
            <h3 class="about-sidebar-title">Inquiries & Contact</h3>
            <p class="about-sidebar-val">
              <a href="mailto:hello@pratikgupta.com" class="about-link">hello@pratikgupta.com</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
